OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted of murdering
OL,4,A64-year-old woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 64-year-old woman at a home
OL,8,Fin Oxfordshire.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police previously said
OL,11,Fits officers had been called to The
OL,12,FPark, in Harwell at about 21:37 GMT on
OL,13,Fthe evening of 27 January this year.
OL,15,FDespite efforts to save the victim,
OL,16,F64-year-old Helen Rundle was pronounced
OL,17,Fdead at the scene, with Carl Rundle
OL,18,Fcharged with murder days later.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
