OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted of murdering
OL,4,A64-year-old woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a three week trial at Oxford
OL,7,FCrown Court, a jury unanimously found
OL,8,FCarl Rundle, 41, guilty of murder. He
OL,9,Fwill be sentenced at the same court on
OL,10,F23 October.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
